    "body": "Golden artifact matching removed every logs- occurrence from artifact names, corrupting legitimate test identifiers such as logs-resume or restore-logs-state and silently skipping their golden values. Remove only the leading artifact prefix.\n\nValidation: actual artifact matcher checks both affected identifiers plus an ordinary test; two baseline failures and all three fixed cases pass. CPU-only identifier tests; Ruff, Black and isort pass.\n\nReview requested: @NVIDIA/mcore-oncall. This PR is ready for review with CPU regression evidence above. Upstream runner validation remains subject to NVIDIA contributor vetting.\n",
